      "value": "jumping is mapped to something on your controllers, if oculus, try the sticks as well.\n\nif vive, try pressing on the touch pad. other than that, I wouldn't know.\n\njumping with both fbt and play space mover do not move your hitbox (the pill that surrounds everyone in vrchat) upward in any way.\n\nit also depends on the world you are in. some worlds don't have jumping enabled for one reason or another, or even by misunderstanding the vrcsdk.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
